{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1793668646068,"sessionID":"ses_e6107b5a3ffeOiP9j8PWmY0U9w","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"toolu_01EjKqoTybT62yPoSHpe3QJm","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd ~/openfang-build; cat launch-round3.sh | head -50; echo ----; tail -60 corrections2-run.log | cut -c1-300; ls corrections2-shots | head -50"},"output":"#!/bin/bash\nIFS= read -r K\nexport OPENROUTER_API_KEY=\"$K\"\ncd ~/openfang-build/repo || exit 1\nsetsid nohup ~/.local/bin/opencode run --auto --format json -m openrouter/anthropic/claude-opus-5.5 \"Implement ROUND3-BRIEF.md exactly. Part A - drawer gestures: remove the X from the drawer header (brand and wordmark only); the hamburger button toggles the drawer open AND closed from every surface that shows it; a drag starting in a ~24px left-edge grab zone pulls the card out following the finger, releasing past ~40 percent of card width or with a flick opens it, releasing earlier snaps shut; with the card open, dragging the card or the scrim leftward follows the finger and closes past the same threshold, a quick leftward swipe closes outright, scrim tap still closes; Pointer Events and transforms only; never hijack vertical scrolling or drags beginning on interactive elements outside the edge zone; ESC closes on desktop; prefers-reduced-motion falls back to the plain toggle with no follow-drag; drawer internals unchanged (one scroll container, sections start closed, OWNER block in flow, no tiles strip). Part B - the grim reaper is the brand: consume the staged assets at ~/openfang-build/icon-assets/reaper/ as-is and never redraw the character: stax-avatar.svg replaces the arrow in the drawer brand tile, the Home header avatar, the TEAM Stax row, the Stax card, and the dock Stax icon; the Home centerpiece becomes the mascot large and centered - ship stax-mascot-phone.png if it holds up at ~180px, else stax-mascot-idle.jpg, and report which; the sign-in screen brand mark becomes the reaper; point the 