button></li>\n            <li><button class=\"sys-row\" @click=\"navigate('overview')\"><span class=\"sys-text\"><span class=\"sys-name\">Overview</span></span><svg class=\"sys-chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#g-chev\"/></svg></button></li>\n            <li><button class=\"sys-row\" @click=\"navigate('comms')\"><span class=\"sys-text\"><span class=\"sys-name\">Team traffic</span></span><svg class=\"sys-chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#g-chev\"/></svg></button></li>\n            <li><button class=\"sys-row\" @click=\"navigate('logs')\"><span class=\"sys-text\"><span class=\"sys-name\">Diagnostics</span></span><svg class=\"sys-chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#g-chev\"/></svg></button></li>\n            <li><button class=\"sys-row\" @click=\"navigate('runtime')\"><span class=\"sys-text\"><span class=\"sys-name\">System status</span></span><svg class=\"sys-chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#g-chev\"/></svg></button></li>\n            <li><button class=\"sys-row\" @click=\"navigate('setup')\"><span class=\"sys-text\"><span class=\"sys-name\">Step-by-step setup</span></span><svg class=\"sys-chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#g-chev\"/></svg></button></li>\n            <li><button class=\"sys-row\" @click=\"$store.app.r4Open = true\"><span class=\"sys-text\"><span class=\"sys-name\">Side chats</span></span><svg class=\"sys-chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#g-chev\"/></svg></button></li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </template>\n\n    <!-- Page: Integrations catalog (System > Advanced). The stock channels\n         console, moved intact out of the Connections landing. -->\n    <template x-if=\"page === 'integrations'\">\n      <div x-data=\"channelsPage\">\n        <div class=\"page-header\">\n          <h2>Integrations catalog <span class=\"badge badge-muted\" x-text=\"configuredCount + '/' + allChannels.length + ' configured'\"></span></h2>\n        </div>","lineStart":2530,"lineEnd":2619,"totalLines":6586,"truncated":true}},"title":"crates/openfang-api/static/index_body.html","time":{"start":1793668699041,"end":1793668699104}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Since img-src allows data: URIs, I could serve the mascot image as a base64-encoded static file included via include_str! in webchat.rs, embedding it directly into the HTML or a style block as a data URI rather than a separate asset request.\n\nBut the full-size 1MB PNG would add ~1.35MB of base64 to every page load under no-store caching, which is too heavy over cellular — I should downscale to something like 360px or convert to WebP to cut it down to tens of KB, treating that as resampling rather than redrawing the actual artwork.\n\nI'll resample down to roughly 400×400, keeping transparent RGBA since the mascot's white JPG background would look bad in dark mode, and keep the full-resolution original safely in static/brand/ for provenance since it's not compiled in. For the vector avatar, I'm planning to embed it as a symbol in the shared sprite sheet, reusing its existing markup as-is.\n\nI'm weighing whether the reaper's dark ink outlines will still read clearly against the teal accent tile used for drawer and home avatars, since the glyph needs to replace the arrow while keeping that same background, and its artwork nearly fills the 32×32 viewBox so I need to make sure it scales well within the circular crop.\n\nFor the dock's Stax icon, I'm planning to swap the mascot-head symbol reference for the reaper symbol, and I'm leaning toward removing the now-unused ic-stax symbol entirely rather than leaving dead sprite clutter that could trip the sprite-count check.\n\nAs for the arrow mark leaving owner surfaces, I'm wondering if it should migrate somewhere as a historical identity mark — maybe into the Advanced page's identity line near the version string. I want to check that page's markup around that section to see if it fits there.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxjbGF1ZGUtb24tYXdzIn0"}]}},"id":"prt_19efc5395001E7K2VRhd1ljubv","sessionID":"ses_e6107b5a3ffeOiP9j8PWmY0U9w","messageID":"msg_19efbfeaa001FeFoYlxt4z78Lj"}}
