s index math — if it never breaks, i ends at -1 making Math.max(0,-1) wrong, and if it does break, the sample at i is too old; I should use first = samples[i+1] in both cases to correctly grab the sample just inside the 90ms window. Also verifying handOffFocus works correctly since visibility becomes visible immediately once is-open is applied, and that it only acts when the previously focused element was a menu button.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxjbGF1ZGUtb24tYXdzIn0"}]}},"id":"prt_19efeb659001Tn1m9Tl6cC1Ypg","sessionID":"ses_e6107b5a3ffeOiP9j8PWmY0U9w","messageID":"msg_19efe876e001zDZtFfVN2VkhxM"}}
